OL,3,GNEWSABudget for economic growth
OL,4,Aproposed by P&R
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's Policy and Resources
OL,7,FCommittee (P&R) has put forward plans
OL,8,Ffor a #15m fund to invest in
OL,9,Fstimulating economic growth across the
OL,10,Fnext three years, in its 2027 budget.
OL,12,FTreasury Lead Charles Parkinson said
OL,13,Fafter years of "sluggish" economic
OL,14,Fgrowth it was time to invest. Officials
OL,15,Fpredict 0.5% GDP growth next year.
OL,17,FThe committee has also put forward
OL,18,Fplans to abolish mortgage interest
OL,19,Frelief, a new tax cap for entrepreneurs
OL,20,Fand reductions to the tax on beer
OL,21,Fbought in pubs.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
