OL,3,GNEWSABudget for economic growth
OL,4,Aproposed by P&R
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week the BBC revealed two budgets
OL,7,Fare being put forward, one including 1%
OL,8,Fsavings in real terms and another with
OL,9,Fspending cuts alongside about #15.7m of
OL,10,Fexpenditure suggested by committees.
